---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'
import Paths from '../components/Paths.astro'
import Pic from '../components/Pic.astro'
---
<Site title="About" description="SIGNAL. is the marketing and growth agency from SIRYUS. We put story at the centre of strategy, campaigns, content and growth.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>A marketing agency built around story.</h1>
      <p>SIGNAL. by SIRYUS helps brands decide what to say, how to say it and how to make it travel.</p>
    </div>
    <Paths />
  </header>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <figure><Pic name="camera-cap" alt="A photographer smiling as he frames a shot outdoors" /></figure>
      <div>
        <h2>Why SIGNAL.</h2>
        <p>A signal is the part of a message that gets through the noise. That is the whole job. Not more posts, more ads or more noise, but the right message reaching the right people.</p>
        <p>Our symbol is three paths meeting at one point: strategy, creativity and execution, all aimed at the same goal. Our period is a full stop, because a good message knows when it is finished.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section dark">
    <div class="wrap closing">
      <h2>Part of SIRYUS.</h2>
      <div>
        <p>SIGNAL. is one of the SIRYUS worlds, alongside SIRYUS A.M and ARC. Creatives. We share a home, but each world has its own work and its own voice.</p>
        <a class="button light" href="https://siryushub.com">Visit SIRYUS</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
